==Release information==
This card was one of five that could be pulled from Promo-B Vol. 6 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Slowpoke Drop Event]], which ran from April 9 to 19, 2026. Players could also obtain one Promo Card Exchange Ticket during the event, which could be redeemed in the shop for one of the pack's five cards until April 26, 2026.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Obsidian Flames|Varoom|154}} from the {{TCG|Obsidian Flames}} expansion.
*{{m|Poison Gas}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Varoom}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

